      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">A comprehensive roadmap for establishing an IT Park in Turkmenistan has been developed, outlining the strategic, regulatory, and operational steps required to create a sustainable and innovation-driven technology ecosystem.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
